'''Century the Fish''' is a {{Special}} [[Fish Family]] item obtained from the [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Raffle of the Century ===
'''Century the Fish''' can be obtained by reaching Milestone VII during the [[Raffle of the Century]], which requires obtaining 400 Raffle Tickets.

During SkyBlock Year 300 [[Raffle of the Century]] event, '''Century the Fish''' could be rolled in the {{Raffle|Speed}} and {{Raffle|Daily}}. There were {{Gold|50x}} '''Century the Fish''' available in the {{Raffle|Speed}} and {{DarkAqua|100x}} available in the {{Raffle|Daily}}.

